%% Happy-path raw postMessage flow. Not the Embed SDK client and not a failure matrix.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser
    participant Host as Host API
    participant Auth0
    participant Looker as Looker API
    participant Iframe as iframe postMessage

    Browser->>Host: GET /login
    Host->>Auth0: GET /authorize (PKCE)
    Auth0->>Browser: redirect /callback?code=
    Browser->>Host: GET /callback?code=
    Host->>Auth0: POST /oauth/token (code + verifier)
    Auth0-->>Host: refresh + access + id
    Note over Host: HostSession created. Auth0 tokens stay on the server.
    Host-->>Browser: Set-Cookie host_session_id (HttpOnly, opaque)
    Browser->>Host: POST /api/host/bootstrap
    Host-->>Browser: host_access_token (~200 s, memory)

    Browser->>Host: POST /api/looker/acquire-embed-session
    Host->>Looker: POST /embed/cookieless_session/acquire
    Looker-->>Host: 4 tokens including session_reference_token
    Note over Host: session_reference_token stored server-side, omitted from JSON.
    Host-->>Browser: authentication_token, navigation_token, api_token + TTLs

    Browser->>Iframe: GET /login/embed/...?embed_authentication_token=
    Note over Iframe: authentication_token consumed (single use, ~30s).
    Iframe->>Browser: postMessage session:tokens:request
    Browser->>Iframe: postMessage session:tokens (api + nav)

    loop Looker asks when either nav or api is inside its last 60s
        Iframe->>Browser: session:tokens:request
        Browser->>Host: PUT /api/looker/generate-embed-tokens
        Host->>Looker: PUT /embed/cookieless_session/generate_tokens
        Looker-->>Host: new nav + api; session_reference TTL counts down
        Note over Host: generate rotates both siblings and leaves the session countdown in place.
        Host-->>Browser: nav + api only
        Browser->>Iframe: session:tokens
    end

    Browser->>Host: POST /api/looker/acquire-embed-session (second iframe)
    Host->>Looker: acquire with stored session_reference_token
    Looker-->>Host: new authentication_token, same session
    Browser->>Iframe: second iframe login URL

    Browser->>Host: POST /logout (CSRF)
    Host->>Looker: DELETE /embed/cookieless_session/{session_reference_token}
    Host->>Auth0: POST /oauth/revoke (refresh)
    Host-->>Browser: clear host_session_id, redirect Auth0 /v2/logout
